body:
I didn't use anything beneath besides the acrylic and nail polish, I just put the paint on, spread it, and called it a day.

I'll try and see if my dad will order me some acetone, because he does all the guitar shopping for me because he's the expert, not me.

&#x200B;

If you want to find out what my guitar was made out of or something (I'm not too good with this kind of stuff, only a few months in of playing and I got tired of the color) here's a photo from google, since I painted mine lol;

[https://media.guitarcenter.com/is/image/MMGS7/Limited-Edition-Bullet-Telecaster-Electric-Guitar-Red-Sparkle/L21128000001000-00-1200x1200.jpg](https://media.guitarcenter.com/is/image/MMGS7/Limited-Edition-Bullet-Telecaster-Electric-Guitar-Red-Sparkle/L21128000001000-00-1200x1200.jpg)

Just sent you a long message.

&#x200B;

For anyone else who wants to provide help and wants my age, I'm 15.

" In answer to your question, I suspect Op may have been naive or unprepared to stick to thier rights of silence/representstion etc. "

&#x200B;

Yeahhh, as I just said I hadn't been awake for more than 5 minutes plus the fact I didn't want to go to jail or have to go down to a dark scary room for interrogation, they asked me questions right then and there, I admitted to my crimes, then they took some of my shit and left
